# ===================================================================
# WANDERLUST FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION (AWS / DOCKER / LOCAL)
# ===================================================================
#
# By default, Wanderlust automatically detects the browser URL (window.location.hostname):
# - Behind an AWS ALB or Nginx reverse proxy on port 80/443: uses http[s]://<your-alb-dns>/api
# - Directly on an AWS EC2 Public IP on port 3000: dynamically calls http://<public-ip>:5000/api
#
# If your backend API is on a completely separate domain, specify it below:
# VITE_API_URL=http://my-alb-123456789.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com/api

